abstract: >
  Manuscript source, deterministic simulation code, canonical synthetic data,
  a paired path-survival diagnostic, a frozen age-stratified Argo CD observation,
  a seeded manual collector audit, programmatically generated tables, and a
  field-study protocol for measuring effort, error, and irrecoverability caused
  by missing operational evidence. Version 1.7.2 makes acceptance independent of
  ground truth, separates optimal debt from policy-specific estimation, and keeps
  policy abstention distinct from physical irrecoverability. The exact version
  is archived at Zenodo under DOI 10.5281/zenodo.21845695.
keywords:
  - "evidence debt"
  - "operational evidence"
  - "record linkage"
  - "cloud-native systems"
  - "reproducibility"
